    "detailed_description": "This is a casual and fun game with a cute cartoon style. In the game, players need to cut the rope and let the candy fall into the mouth of the cute little monster. As the level increases, the difficulty of the game also increases, which tests the player's observation ability and also requires some physical knowledge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame gameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a very interesting casual game with three levels. Different methods will have different results! Testing your operational skills and making accurate judgments is crucial for successful clearance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers need to cut ropes (with the left mouse button) to complete the task.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers need to hold down the left mouse button and slide. Used to cut iron chains.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe candy is on the iron chain.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe iron chain will remain in a swinging state.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need to ensure that the candy can accurately fall into the little monster's mouth!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThen you can enter the next level!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features multiple colors and a cute 2D graphics style.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Extremely exquisite game graphics!",
